  {
   "id": 18,
   "attributes": {
    "title": "Arabian Travel Market",
    "date": "May 6-9, 2023",
    "location": "Dubai",
    "description": "Our CEO, Ralf Usbeck, participated in a panel discussion about the future of travel technology and how web3 and blockchain will revolutionize the industry. He shared the stage with tech pioneers and web3 experts, including Arul Prakash, Founder & CEO of Buk Technology, Ajay Ponna Venkatesh, Senior VP of Polygon Labs, & Maurício Marques, Founder & CEO of Yacooba Labs. It was an insightful conversation proving that web3 is not a passing \"fad\" but the future of traveltech.",
