    "date": "June 28-30, 2023",
    "location": "Hamburg ",
    "description": "We heard lots of interesting talks about the opportunities of blockchain and gained insights on: MiCA regulation, navigating crypto asset regulation in the EU, the importance of improved user experience for mass adoption, the opportunities for NFTs to reimagine loyalty systems. The highlight, however, was Ralf Usbeck on stage with Sophia Rödiger & Harry Behrens from bloXmove and Jonathan K. from peaq discussing decentralized mobility. \n",
