  {
   "id": 25,
   "attributes": {
    "title": "World Aviation Festival",
    "date": "Sep 26-28, 2023",
    "location": "Lisbon",
    "description": "What an amazing time we had in Lisbon, forging new connections with Airlines and tech providers. \n3 takeaways from Anke's presentation \"Future-Proof Direct Distribution\": (1) Today's direct distribution is on the verge of transformation towards tomorrow's web3 network distribution. (2) Minimized costs and reduced time-to-market through connecting to the network. (3) Camino Network bridges web2 to web3 and fosters the approach: \"Connect once, connect to all.\"\n",
    "createdAt": "2023-10-16T08:50:38.382Z",
    "updatedAt": "2023-12-06T10:15:18.775Z",
